**Refuse the revoke on every conversion failure, not only three named ones.**

`run_conversion` maps acknowledgement failures and post-acknowledgement record-persist failures to generic `EngineError::Seam` errors. The current match ignores those errors and continues to `cut_and_rotate`. This can remove the invite link while the claim remains on the inbox and cannot convert through that link.

Return every non-trust error from `run_conversion` so the caller can retry the revoke.


